<title>SRI LANKA: Blue Diamonds up on good growth prospects.</title>
<headline>Blue Diamonds up on good growth prospects.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue Diamonds Jewellery Worldwide Ltd rose 7.5 percent, or 75 cents, to 10.75 on local buying of 102,100 shares on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;It is all part of the general optimism we are seeing, with investors expecting better corporate growth in 1997,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The company makes diamond and gem-studded jewellery, mainly for export.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
